# Version Control

## Mục tiêu

Version Control là nền tảng cho software development collaboration, tracking changes, và maintaining code history. Trong Cursor Enterprise Framework, Git là primary version control system với practices đảm bảo code quality, traceability, và efficient team collaboration. Mục tiêu của rule này là hướng dẫn developers trong việc use version control một cách hiệu quả và maintainable.

Good version control practices enable parallel development, facilitate code review, support rollback capabilities, và maintain clear audit trail của mọi thay đổi.

## Nguyên tắc

**1. Atomic Commits**

Một commit nên chứa một logical change. Small, focused commits. Easy to revert. Clear history.

**2. Clear Commit Messages**

Descriptive messages. Follow convention. Reference issues. Explain why, not what.

**3. Branching Strategy**

Use consistent strategy. Feature branches. Release branches. Hotfix branches.

**4. Protected Main Branch**

main/master không directly committed. All changes via PR. Required reviews. Passing tests.

**5. Frequent Integration**

Merge frequently. Small changes. Reduce conflicts. Continuous integration.

**6. Code Review**

All changes reviewed. Meaningful reviews. Timely reviews. Constructive feedback.

**7. Tagging Releases**

Semantic versioning. Annotated tags. Release notes. Traceability.

**8. .gitignore**

Ignore build artifacts. Ignore dependencies. Ignore IDE configs. Keep repo clean.

**9. Submodules/Libraries**

Manage dependencies carefully. Keep updated. Document usage. Consider monorepo.

**10. Backup và Safety**

Remote backups. Never force push to main. Recoverable history. Branch protection.

